### Get all workouts before any exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workouts

### Create a workout with multiple sets
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workoutDate": "2026-11-02",
  "notes": "Push day",
  "sets": [
    { "exerciseName": "Bench Press", "setNumber": 1, "reps": 8, "weightLbs": 135 },
    { "exerciseName": "Bench Press", "setNumber": 2, "reps": 8, "weightLbs": 135 },
    { "exerciseName": "Overhead Press", "setNumber": 1, "reps": 10, "weightLbs": 65 }
  ]
}

### Create another workout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workoutDate": "2026-11-03",
  "notes": "Pull day",
  "sets": [
    { "exerciseName": "Deadlift", "setNumber": 1, "reps": 5, "weightLbs": 225 }
  ]
}

### Validation error: no sets
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workoutDate": "2026-11-04",
  "notes": "Empty workout",
  "sets": []
}

### Validation error: invalid set values
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workoutDate": "2026-11-04",
  "notes": "Bad set",
  "sets": [
    { "exerciseName": "", "setNumber": -1, "reps": -5, "weightLbs": -10 }
  ]
}

### List all workouts, newest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workouts

### Get one workout by id (replace 1 with a real id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/1

### Get a workout that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/9999

### Delete a workout by id (replace 1 with a real id)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/1

### Delete a workout that doesn't exist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/9999
